# ── OS / editor / tool cruft ────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.code-workspace
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Local dev tools (not part of the deployed site) ─────────────────
dev-server.js
start-local.cmd
start-local.sh

# ── Source & working material — kept on disk, NOT published ─────────
# The built site is self-contained; these are inputs/backups only.
# Delete the lines you'd rather version-control (e.g. in a PRIVATE repo).
# root-level source images (the PWA icons in assets/icons/ are still published)
*.docx
*.zip
*.py
/*.png
build-spec.json
mc-data.json

# original app revisions — canonical apps are build-lab.html / masterclass.html
sa-trophy-truck-*.html
mcd-masterclass-shed.html

# loose source schematics at the repo root (copies live in notebook/schematics/)
/*.svg

# source notes / briefs that seed the Notebook (not served)
*.md

# …but DO publish the project docs and the brand favicon
!README.md
!DECISIONS.md
!DEPLOY.md
!TODO-DANIEL.md
!ACCEPTANCE.md
!favicon.svg
